---
// Job life cycle; list names from /jobs/stats (queued, processing, delayed, dead). MAX_ATTEMPTS = 4 per the C-BAD capture.
---
<figure class="bep8j">
  <div class="bep8j-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 340" role="img" aria-label="Job states. A queued job is claimed into processing with BLMOVE. From processing it is acked and gone, or it fails and goes to delayed with a wait and later back to queued, or after the fourth attempt it goes to dead. If the worker crashes, requeue_orphans moves processing jobs back to queued.">
    <rect x="40" y="110" width="150" height="56" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="115" y="134" text-anchor="middle" class="h">queued</text>
    <text x="115" y="154" text-anchor="middle" class="s">jobs:reports</text>

    <rect x="330" y="110" width="150" height="56" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="405" y="134" text-anchor="middle" class="h">processing</text>
    <text x="405" y="154" text-anchor="middle" class="s">jobs:reports:processing</text>

    <rect x="680" y="110" width="150" height="56" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="755" y="134" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>done</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>xong</tspan></text>
    <text x="755" y="154" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>removed by ack</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bị xoá bởi ack</tspan></text>

    <rect x="40" y="250" width="150" height="56" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="115" y="274" text-anchor="middle" class="h">delayed</text>
    <text x="115" y="294" text-anchor="middle" class="s">sorted set</text>

    <rect x="530" y="250" width="150" height="56" rx="8" class="bad" />
    <text x="605" y="274" text-anchor="middle" class="h red">dead</text>
    <text x="605" y="294" text-anchor="middle" class="s">jobs:reports:dead</text>

    <line x1="190" y1="138" x2="320" y2="138" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="320,133 330,138 320,143" class="ah" />
    <text x="255" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="code">BLMOVE</text>

    <line x1="480" y1="138" x2="670" y2="138" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="670,133 680,138 670,143" class="ah" />
    <text x="575" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>handler succeeded: LREM</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>handler xong: LREM</tspan></text>

    <line x1="360" y1="166" x2="190" y2="262" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="199,252 190,262 203,264" class="ah" />
    <text x="268" y="268" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>failed: retry later</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lỗi: thử lại sau</tspan></text>

    <line x1="115" y1="250" x2="115" y2="176" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="110,176 115,166 120,176" class="ah" />
    <text x="130" y="216" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>wait is over</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hết thời gian chờ</tspan></text>

    <line x1="430" y1="166" x2="560" y2="250" class="ln red" />
    <polygon points="548,246 560,250 553,240" class="ah red" />
    <text x="514" y="240" text-anchor="end" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>failed on attempt 4</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lỗi ở lần thứ 4</tspan></text>

    <path d="M405 110 V62 H115 V100" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="110,100 115,110 120,100" class="ah" />
    <text x="260" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>worker crashed: requeue_orphans at startup</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>worker chết: requeue_orphans khi khởi động</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A job is always in exactly one list. Failure moves it to another list; nothing is ever dropped.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một job luôn nằm trong đúng một list. Lỗi chỉ chuyển nó sang list khác; không có gì bị rơi mất.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep8j { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep8j-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep8j svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 760px; height: auto; }
  .bep8j text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep8j .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep8j .h.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8j .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep8j .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep8j .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep8j .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep8j .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep8j .ln.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .bep8j .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep8j .ah.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8j figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
